00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.580
What is a hypothesis function?

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.120
Yes, and remind me of your name.
Actually, tell me the first

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.420
letter of it, and I'll try and
