00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.420
A.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.040
I'm sorry, I don't remember.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:36.620
Allison.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.300
Yes.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.000
OK.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.580
You said that a hypothesis
