00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:45.240
Good.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.460
A hypothesis function is the
function we use to make our

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:51.560
predictions.
So it takes in features, which

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:55.400
are our input variables as an
input, and what it returns is a

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.650
