00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:18.380
matter what input you give it.
Whether you leave at 6 AM, 8 AM,

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:19.840
9.30
AM, 11.45

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:20.840
PM,

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.020
the constant model returns the
same prediction.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:26.880
And so then the question is,
what prediction should it

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:27.880
