00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.140
70, and 100.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:41.220
And the question we left off
Tuesday's lecture with was, is,

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.200
well, which constant should it
predict?

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.800
Where should we draw this
