00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.520
Yes, and remind me of your name?
I'm Alex.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.020
Alex, right.
I think you used W.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:29.800
W,

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:30.800
good.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.540
And w,

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:39.260
what did I call a w on Tuesday?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.760
Yes, remind me of your name?

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:41.460
Andrew.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.340
I called it a parameter.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.590
A parameter, good.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:55.100
Parameters are aspects of our
