You had W of 0 and then W of 1.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.700
Good.
It says,

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:56.160
take in your xi and actually do
something with it.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:59.760
What I mean by that is these
