That's an orange.

00:48:45.250 --> 00:48:47.470
h of xi equals w

00:48:47.470 --> 00:48:54.210
is

00:48:54.210 --> 00:48:58.290
going to use that same symbol
from before,

00:48:58.290 --> 00:48:59.290
R.

00:49:02.750 --> 00:49:07.250
First, I want to write this
