00:50:02.730 --> 00:50:08.070
And what I divide all of the spy
is the number of data points.

00:50:08.070 --> 00:50:09.070
Good.

00:50:09.510 --> 00:50:12.570
Now, this formula looks a little
more confusing than the one we

00:50:12.570 --> 00:50:15.550
