00:51:44.010 --> 00:51:45.790
Then plug in i equals 2,

00:51:45.790 --> 00:51:46.850
whatever that is,

00:51:46.850 --> 00:51:48.210
add it to my total.

00:51:48.210 --> 00:51:51.550
And keeps adding this up sort of
