There's a subtle difference.

00:52:15.210 --> 00:52:16.170
For summation,

00:52:16.170 --> 00:52:17.350
it's inclusive? Yeah,

00:52:17.350 --> 00:52:22.050
it includes both i equals 1 and
i equals n.

00:52:22.050 --> 00:52:22.570
